{"id": "1.4-00020", "case_id": "github/lawrie/fpga_pio", "parent_id": null, "source": "github/lawrie/fpga_pio", "record_protocol": null, "panels": {"stored": "<h2>Agent task and scoring</h2><div class='card'><table><tbody><tr><th style='width:175px'>Input task</th><td class='path'>Clean project in Stage 1; validated intermediate specification and public interface contract in Stage 2</td></tr><tr><th style='width:175px'>Agent context</th><td class='path'>Stage 1 clean RTL closure: 9 paths pinned in case.json. Stage 2 receives the accepted generated specification and its declared interface/output contract. Stage workspaces are assembled by the runner; bundled testbenches are not agent context.</td></tr><tr><th style='width:175px'>Expected output</th><td class='path'>Reconstructed project RTL: src/pio.v, src/machine.v, src/decoder.v, src/divider.v, src/pc.v, src/scratch.v, src/fifo.v, src/isr.v and 1 more.</td></tr><tr><th style='width:175px'>Hidden reference</th><td class='path'>Clean project RTL pinned by case.json source_closure.</td></tr><tr><th style='width:175px'>Private score</th><td class='path'>Passed verification testpoints divided by total testpoints, using testbenches or formal verification<br><strong>10 verification testpoints:</strong> sim/copybit.v, sim/exec.v, sim/i2s.v, sim/pwm.v, sim/square.v, sim/stepper.v, sim/tb.v, sim/uart_rx.v, and 2 more.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>Case-stored agent instruction</h2><div class='card'><p class='warn'>No exact agent prompt is retained in this case package. The input/output summary above is the benchmark contract; consult the evaluation runner and its saved trajectory for the actual prompt.</p></div>"}, "files": [{"name": "case.json", "url": "assets/fd1c42a9372906ce66fa4856c31f241a646b71b6b24be2bd9c319fa2c7600296.txt", "size": 33209, "binary": false, "section": "Other: case.json"}, {"name": "payload/meta.json", "url": "assets/9791332062ce1a9d6085e2d81da41c802b48c6aa6196e9e023ebdd12e0b56a65.txt", "size": 4312